{%- if page.handle == 'badge-blank' or page.handle == 'name-tag-blanks' or template.suffix == 'name-tag-blanks' -%}
<section class="aqb-bl-seo" aria-label="About blank name tags and badge blanks">
  <div class="aqb-bl-seo__inner">
    <h2 class="aqb-bl-seo__heading">Blank Name Tags &amp; Badge Blanks — Ready to Personalize</h2>
    <p class="aqb-bl-seo__text">
      Whether you're stocking up for your engraving business, outfitting a school, or preparing badges for a conference, our blank name tags give you a clean, professional starting point — ready for laser engraving, UV printing, rotary engraving, or your own custom labels.
    </p>

    <h3 class="aqb-bl-seo__subheading">Available sizes and shapes</h3>
    <ul class="aqb-bl-seo__list">
      <li>1x3 Rounded Rectangle — the most popular name tag size</li>
      <li>1.5x3 Rounded Rectangle — larger format for more text</li>
      <li>Oval — elegant and distinctive</li>
      <li>Square Corner — sharp, modern look</li>
      <li>Designer — decorative shape for hospitality and events</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="aqb-bl-seo__subheading">Three backing types</h3>
    <ul class="aqb-bl-seo__list">
      <li>Magnetic — no holes, no pins, attaches and removes cleanly</li>
      <li>Pin — classic fastening, compatible with any badge holder</li>
      <li>Adhesive — peel-and-stick for temporary use and events</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="aqb-bl-seo__subheading">Used by</h3>
    <p class="aqb-bl-seo__text">
      Engravers, trophy shops, schools, churches, hospitals, corporate offices, and event organizers across the United States. Pack sizes from 10 to 250. Free shipping on qualifying orders. All orders ship from our US facility within 1–2 business days.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

